chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Bitcoin from first principles: chapter 1 of Mastering Bitcoin, 3rd edition, and Bitcoin today"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the book's own source at tag third_edition_print1. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-09-25T07:51:05; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.4." ;
